    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEFORE BUYING: This is a short horror puzzle experience.  It's a scare simulator. Solve the puzzles, and escape the house, you've got 5 hours. You can use your microphone to distract the enemy or to do certain in game events.</strong></h2><br><strong>The game may contain bugs, I'm actively working on it and improving it.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/d754a04a222ec003d64664867367e59b.avif?t=1738487272\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/04950aac2f3eb91997868d84ad6df8df.avif?t=1738487272\" width=600 height=452 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychopath Massacre is a first-person short psychological horror game with a VHS effect. (It's a short puzzle game) Be cautious and observant, because a sinister psychopath lurks within these rooms, hidden in the shadows and monitoring your every step.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/c6a468574082e949e764e13326836290.poster.avif?t=1738487272\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/c6a468574082e949e764e13326836290.webm?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/c6a468574082e949e764e13326836290.mp4?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/9d2cf830a0c5ced0b395ee811bb136e2.webp?t=1738487272\" width=616 height=52 /></span><br>Authorities in <strong>Romania</strong> discover a very unsettling record detailing, <strong>the horrible murders committed by a single person during a police raid on a home.</strong> Approximately <strong>60 videotapes, recorded by the psychopath and documenting the graphic details of his killings</strong>, are among the discoveries. Law enforcement teams from both state and federal agencies carefully <strong>examine the graphic footage to find crucial hints such as the name of the murderer, the victims' identities, and possible leads regarding his whereabouts.</strong> Even after numerous viewings,<strong> the tapes don't provide much information other than the terrifying reality of the atrocities.</strong> The powerful effect of the gruesome visuals unnerves detectives as they probe further into the insane mind that produced the recordings.<br><br>After months of investigation, <strong>one tape, in particular, draws the attention of the authorities despite the abundance of others</strong>. <strong><i>Florentina, the victim</i></strong>, recorded this tape, which <strong>unintentionally revealed the identify of the attacker and shows her frantic attempt to break free from the grip of her attacker. </strong>Through close examination of the video, <strong>the authorities are able to reconstruct Florentina's terrifying experience inside the house as well as the identity of the criminal.</strong> With the potential to make significant progress toward catching the offender and providing the victims with justice, this vital evidence acts as a ray of hope for the investigation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/4776545bb47b381176dace82df154605.poster.avif?t=1738487272\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/4776545bb47b381176dace82df154605.webm?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/4776545bb47b381176dace82df154605.mp4?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/838e0dc54c03fd3535387e1168348df5.webp?t=1738487272\" width=616 height=52 /></span><br><strong>George Dinescu imprisons you within his home</strong>, refusing to let you go. A pounding headache wakes you up in a dimly lit room, reminding you of a hard blow to the head. <strong>Your flashlight, is the only source of illumination.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/df3c5ef591fb0062282f429713d4108f.poster.avif?t=1738487272\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/df3c5ef591fb0062282f429713d4108f.webm?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/df3c5ef591fb0062282f429713d4108f.mp4?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The main exit is sealed behind a series of locks, forcing you to search the house for keys and other items required to unlock the door to freedom.</strong> However, caution is advised because <strong>the psychopath has acute hearing; any sound, whether a dropped object or a creaking floorboard, indicates his imminent arrival. Beware of his bear traps. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/753fb9058e6745ebee6fd15806257c61.poster.avif?t=1738487272\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/753fb9058e6745ebee6fd15806257c61.webm?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/753fb9058e6745ebee6fd15806257c61.mp4?t=1738487272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Choose from three difficulty levels: Hard, Normal, and Easy.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917620/extras/b645083a10130876a1d43b2a2737affd.webp?t=1738487272\" width=616 height=52 /></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>True Survival Horror Experience: You are no fighter, and your only chance of surviving the horrors of the house is to escape... or hide.<br></li><li>Immersive Graphics: RETRO VHS quality graphics provide gamers a complex, horrifying environment to explore.<br></li><li>Hide &amp; Seek: Stealthy gameplay with parkour areas and hide zones.<br></li><li>Unpredictable Enemy: Players have no idea when, or from where.<br></li><li>The game has speech recognition, use your microphone to distract the enemy or trigger certain game events.<br></li><li>In game shop, beat the game on certain difficulties, earn coins and customize your game.</li></ul></h2></strong>",
